      "value": "I agree with this. It can be opt-in as well, as to reduce bandwidth and reduce abuse. \n\nEven just 128 Kbps Opus audio sounds good already, or they can just add another voice layer so the music is at least logically separate. I know it would cost more bandwidth, but it would at least allow better moderation/separation, so I can at least hear people without muting them.",
