  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-29T13:53:55.294Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice if there was a second audio channel at a high bit-rate for people who are fond of playing music from their mic. \n\nWhy?\n\nI am tired of hearing people blasting music everywhere. Making it an opt in thing, coupled with its own volume slider would be nice. \n\nPossibly How to implement:\n\nMaybe have the nameplate show an icon that would let you know they have an audio stream, then you click on them to enable it in the user tab. That would be nice and clear up the air. Also, I could still hear the user themselves as well. No need to mute them outright",
